<title>USA: Pacific Research wins 20 new product orders.</title>
<headline>Pacific Research wins 20 new product orders.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Research &amp; Engineering on Friday said it has booked orders from various domestic broadcasters for 20 new Integrity digital on-air console systems.</p>
<p>The Integrity consoles were introduced in early April as the National Association of Broadcasters convention in Las Vegas.</p>
